      "content": "That makes sense for the background section. For the part of my paper where I'm looking at the \"pro\" side of the debate, can you go into more detail on the specific evidence they rely on? Like, what are the actual studies or specific datasets they usually point to when they talk about those genetic variants or the IQ gaps? I want to explain their logic clearly so I can critique it properly later.",
